---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="A secure command center for document legalization, certified translations, status evidence, and cross-border filing handoffs." />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Apostille Me" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Apostille orchestration for expats, families, founders, and immigration teams." />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#7c3aed" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>Apostille Me — Apostille orchestration for expats, families, founders, and immigration teams.</title>
  </head>
  <body style="--accent: #7c3aed; --accent-2: #06b6d4;">
    <main class="page-shell">
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary">
        <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Apostille Me"><span class="brand-mark"></span><span>Apostille Me</span></a>
        <div class="nav-links"><a href="#platform">Platform</a><a href="#workflow">Workflow</a><a href="#integrations">Integrations</a><a href="#launch" class="nav-cta">Launch</a></div>
      </nav>
      <section id="top" class="hero section-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">apostille-me · operator-grade software</p>
          <h1>Apostille orchestration for expats, families, founders, and immigration teams.</h1>
          <p class="hero-text">A secure command center for document legalization, certified translations, status evidence, and cross-border filing handoffs.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="mailto:hello@apostille-me.com?subject=Start%20a%20document%20chain">Start a document chain</a><a class="button secondary" href="#platform">Audit a filing packet</a></div>
          <div class="trust-row" aria-label="Proof points"><span>Immigration-ready packet review</span>
<span>Evidence trail for every handoff</span>
<span>Customer timeline in plain English</span></div>
        </div>
        <aside class="hero-panel" aria-label="Product snapshot">
          <div class="pulse-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="stat-card"><strong>50-state</strong><span>document routing model</span></div>
          <div class="signal-list"><p>Designed for</p><h2>expats, immigration lawyers, document runners, remote workers, and families handling multi-jurisdiction paperwork</h2></div>
        </aside>
      </section>
      <section id="platform" class="platform">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Platform</p><h2>Everything needed to move from idea to reliable operation.</h2><p>Each module is designed to stand alone, but the real value shows up when intake, automation, routing, and analytics share one source of truth.</p></div>
        <div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-dot"></span><h3>Document chain of custody</h3><p>Track originals, scans, notarizations, state apostilles, federal steps, translations, and delivery windows in one evidence-grade timeline.</p></article>
<article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-dot"></span><h3>Smart intake</h3><p>Collect signer, jurisdiction, deadline, destination country, and special handling rules before work starts.</p></article>
<article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-dot"></span><h3>Status evidence vault</h3><p>Store receipts, tracking IDs, clerk notes, PDFs, and reviewer comments with immutable activity history.</p></article>
<article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-dot"></span><h3>Agent-ready workflows</h3><p>Route work to runners, notaries, translators, and attorneys while keeping customers updated automatically.</p></article></div>
      </section>
      <section id="workflow" class="workflow section-grid">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Workflow</p><h2>A clean operating loop for customers and internal teams.</h2><p>Start with a simple request, turn it into a durable system of record, then keep every person and integration in sync.</p></div>
        <ol class="steps"><li><span>01</span><strong>Capture the document goal</strong></li>
<li><span>02</span><strong>Verify jurisdiction and destination rules</strong></li>
<li><span>03</span><strong>Route the apostille packet</strong></li>
<li><span>04</span><strong>Notify every handoff</strong></li>
<li><span>05</span><strong>Deliver a complete evidence bundle</strong></li></ol>
      </section>
      <section id="integrations" class="integrations"><div class="section-heading compact"><p class="eyebrow">Integrations</p><h2>Connect the systems that already run the business.</h2></div><div class="integration-marquee"><span>UPS/FedEx tracking</span>
<span>Google Drive</span>
<span>Notary queues</span>
<span>Translation vendors</span>
<span>Embassy checklists</span>
<span>Email/SMS updates</span></div></section>
      <section class="architecture">
        <div class="arch-card large"><p class="eyebrow">Architecture</p><h2>Astro front-end, edge Worker APIs, and typed client contracts.</h2><p>The repo family is split so marketing can ship independently while clients, libraries, monorepo services, and Cloudflare infrastructure evolve through reviewable pull requests.</p></div>
        <div class="arch-card"><strong>Astro</strong><span>Static, fast, GitHub Pages-ready.</span></div>
        <div class="arch-card"><strong>Workers</strong><span>Edge intake, webhooks, alerts, and health probes.</span></div>
        <div class="arch-card"><strong>SDKs</strong><span>Fetch-first clients with generated language targets.</span></div>
      </section>
      <section id="launch" class="launch"><p class="eyebrow">Launch path</p><h2>Ready to turn the org into a real product surface.</h2><p>Push the generated repo family, open the bootstrap PRs, connect Cloudflare secrets, then enable GitHub Pages for this Astro site.</p><a class="button primary" href="mailto:hello@apostille-me.com?subject=Launch%20Apostille%20Me">Open the launch checklist</a></section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
